From 9010b7e57ee1d703a28a098a2fd63636c7df2949 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Josh Boyd <boydjd@jbip.net>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 15:15:07 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 12/13] hw/riscv/esp32s31: UART1-3, timer groups, RTC timer,
 LP_SYS, IO_MUX

UART1-3 (serial ports 3-5) with the S31 register layout and loopback;
the timer groups' watchdog (system reset) and RTC slow clock
calibration; the RTC timer counting a 136 kHz slow clock; LP_SYS
registers that survive resets; IO_MUX registers.  The co-processor
stand-in answers sensor requests.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0158d423kzUx8WWBMMEZ95NX
